{"speciesId":539,"names":{"fr":"Karaclée","es":"Sawk","en":"Sawk","ja":"ダゲキ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Dans les montagnes où il s’entraîne, on peut l’entendre donner des coups de poing aux rochers et aux grands arbres."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The sound of Sawk punching boulders and trees can be heard all the way from the mountains where they train."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il noue sa ceinture, il est plus concentré et ses coups font plus mal. Il s’énerve si on gêne son entraînement."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Tying their belts gets them pumped and makes their punches more destructive. Disturbing their training angers them."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Pour accéder à la maîtrise ultime du karaté, il se retire dans les montagnes et s’entraîne nuit et jour."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para lograr dominar las técnicas de kárate más letales, se retiran a las montañas y entrenan día y noche."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"最強の からてチョップを 求めて 山奥に こもって 眠ることなく 修行する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il noue sa ceinture, il est plus concentré et ses coups font plus mal. Il s’énerve si on gêne son entraînement."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La potencia de sus puñetazos aumenta si se aprieta el cinturón. Si le molestan cuando se entrena, se enfada."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Tying their belts gets them pumped and makes their punches more destructive. Disturbing their training angers them."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"帯を 締めると 気合いが 入り パンチの 破壊力が 増す。 修行を ジャマすると 怒る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pour accéder à la maîtrise ultime du karaté, il se retire dans les montagnes et s’entraîne nuit et jour."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Para lograr dominar las técnicas de kárate más letales, se retiran a las montañas y entrenan día y noche."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"最強の からてチョップを 求めて 山奥に こもって 眠ることなく 修行する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand il noue sa ceinture, il est plus concentré et ses coups font plus mal. Il s’énerve si on gêne son entraînement."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La potencia de sus puñetazos aumenta si se aprieta el cinturón. Si le molestan cuando se entrena, se enfada."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tying their belts gets them pumped and makes their punches more destructive. Disturbing their training angers them."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"帯を 締めると 気合いが 入り パンチの 破壊力が 増す。 修行を ジャマすると 怒る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il cherche à tout prix à devenir plus fort. Il est conseillé de ne pas le déranger quand il s’entraîne en montagne."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Viven obsesionados con hacerse más fuertes. Si se los encuentra entrenando en la montaña, lo más recomendable es alejarse en silencio."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If you see a Sawk training in the mountains in its single-minded pursuit of strength, it’s best to quietly pass by."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ひたすらに 強さを 求める。 山で 修行する ダゲキを 見たら 静かに 立ち去ろう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Après avoir suivi un entraînement intensif, la puissance du tranchant de sa main est telle qu’il peut fendre la mer 